{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta","id":756895,"title":"Dragon Blood ETA?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-05T10:48:56-08:00","id":756895,"title":"Dragon Blood ETA?","content":"Hi. Just wondering when we might see the books that are now in second draft form become available as PDFs. Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8508-phaide","name":"Phaide","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T10:51:29-08:00","id":756923,"title":"","content":"Dude, the core book hasn't even been released that.<br /> <br /> Maybe wait for 3e to actually be out before asking after supplements for it.<br /> <br /> Also too: I've heard that at least some of the line devs are pushing for a kickstarter for the DB book. So look for that first; I'm sure Rich will announce a decision on that either way relatively soon after the core drops.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;SEX NOVA is the kind of person who, after being chosen as the divine champion of the god of heroes, decided to call himself SEX NOVA.&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4742-murcushio","name":"Murcushio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4742_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1249"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T11:02:14-08:00","id":756937,"title":"","content":"Dude, relax. I understand it hasn't officially come out yet. That's irrelevant to the question. They have other books already in the pipeline and last time I checked there was no harm in asking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8508-phaide","name":"Phaide","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T11:04:26-08:00","id":756942,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murcushio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=756923#post756923\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dude, the core book hasn't even been released that.<br /> <br /> Maybe wait for 3e to actually be out before asking after supplements for it.<br /> <br /> Also too: I've heard that at least some of the line devs are pushing for a kickstarter for the DB book. So look for that first; I'm sure Rich will announce a decision on that either way relatively soon after the core drops.</div> </div> </div> </div>As of last week's Monday Meeting (just before the Paradox announcement), Rich's response as to whether any of the in-progress Exalted books would get a KS was that 'possibly' was the best he could pin it down right then. Dunno whether anything's changed on that front after his meeting with Paradox.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T11:08:14-08:00","id":756948,"title":"","content":"I appreciate the update. Thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8508-phaide","name":"Phaide","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T11:35:49-08:00","id":756995,"title":"","content":"I also recall Holden saying that if he had his way the Kickstarter wouldn't go up until the book was finished and it would be released to backers as soon as pledges close. If that's the case they'll have my backing again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T11:42:54-08:00","id":756999,"title":"","content":"That also means no extra charms/spells/MA/etc as stretch goals","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T11:46:43-08:00","id":757008,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnum Opus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=756999#post756999\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That also means no extra charms/spells/MA/etc as stretch goals</div> </div> </div> </div>IIRC one of the stretch goals for the core was for the backers to add their own custom charms, which are going to be put into a PDF after the book is released rather than slowing everything down enough for them to add the custom charms to the actual book. They may do the same thing with later books.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">My homebrew: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1244979-abyssals-a-shadow-falls\" target=\"_blank\">Abyssals,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1065949-infernals-to-rule-in-hell-complete-edition\" target=\"_blank\">Infernals,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/781489-ex3-dragon-kings-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Dragon Kings,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1058142-lanaya-s-martial-arts-homebrew-compendium\" target=\"_blank\">martial arts.</a></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3559-lanaya","name":"Lanaya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3559_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"960"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T12:50:44-08:00","id":757131,"title":"","content":"February 2016.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T12:58:05-08:00","id":757138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=757131#post757131\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">February 2016.</div> </div> </div> </div>If it's currently in a second draft, and given how long the core was in editing and layout, this seems unrealistic. I'm hoping &quot;by this time next year&quot;, myself.<br /> <br /> Though a preliminary PDF for KS backers - text only, no layout or art or whatnot - might be available as early as February, that I grant you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Known elsewhere as Kurulham. Void where permitted.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/s/d34vnu2hx0ifmk5/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4277-jackson-mackenzie","name":"Jackson MacKenzie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4277_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T13:06:08-08:00","id":757148,"title":"","content":"For whatever it's worth Holden on Facebook is talking optimistically about goodies Paradox might approve (just his hopes, not inside knowledge) - which does at least imply in Exalted's case what Rich relayed from his meeting with the new White Wolf chief is positive about everything moving forward (everything overall has been positive from Rich publicaly, but we don't know which things in the works may be completely re shaped by Paradox's plans, but Holden at least no longer sounds like &quot;gee I hope I still have a job&quot; like a lot of the freelancers sounded after the initial news of the buyout broke)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T13:06:45-08:00","id":757149,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure that once the layout guides have been created, further books will be a lot faster to edit and create.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T13:07:37-08:00","id":757151,"title":"","content":"Exalted 3rd Core is not representative of anything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T13:29:43-08:00","id":757177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=757131#post757131\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">February 2016.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm thinking one Exalted release per quarter, with Ex3's official release coming Q1 2016, Arms of the Chosen Q2, and then Dragon Blooded Q3. (or else Ex3 and Arms of the Chosen in early Q1 and Dragonblooded/The Realm in late Q2)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a Woman, I'm a GM. <i>Of course</i> I'm Evil.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/424-dawaterrat","name":"DaWaterRat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T13:30:26-08:00","id":757180,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=757151#post757151\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exalted 3rd Core is not representative of anything.</div> </div> </div> </div>This. Building a system core from scratch and playtesting it to find the flaws is a lot different from building a supplement to fit within the existing structure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T13:36:13-08:00","id":757183,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=757151#post757151\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exalted 3rd Core is not representative of anything.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is super important for people unfamiliar with the scope of E3 to remember. To recap and elaborate further: The kickstarter wasnt for funding exalted 3, that was already in works. The design philosophy for this edition was to get /everything/ conceptually finished before launch. So not only was the dev team building a new core engine for exalted to run on, they were also doing charm development and system creation for Every Splat. If they found issues affecting one part of th system then changes to that reverberated to every other part they were designing. It taking this long to launch the core system is literally the biggest hurdle, everything else has some amount of work done on it. So its okay to be more optimistic about release times.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Exalted: Princes of the Universe<br /> A Third Edition Exalted Podcast<br /> <b><u><a href=\"http://atrusilk.podbean.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://atrusilk.podbean.com/</a></u></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8769-tavelgorge","name":"TavelGorge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8769_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"498"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T14:21:30-08:00","id":757285,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DaWaterRat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=757177#post757177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm thinking one Exalted release per quarter, with Ex3's official release coming Q1 2016, Arms of the Chosen Q2, and then Dragon Blooded Q3. (or else Ex3 and Arms of the Chosen in early Q1 and Dragonblooded/The Realm in late Q2)</div> </div> </div> </div>Your second one sounds better. I'm thinking a major release and a supplement per quarter for the first two years.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T20:34:34-08:00","id":757826,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=757131#post757131\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">February 2016.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you being facetiously specific, making a guess, or is there info that supercedes what's currently on the schedule? At present, it's only given as &quot;On the horizon&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2163-venatius","name":"Venatius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2163_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T21:21:53-08:00","id":757917,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DaWaterRat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=757177#post757177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm thinking one Exalted release per quarter, with Ex3's official release coming Q1 2016, Arms of the Chosen Q2, and then Dragon Blooded Q3.</div> </div> </div> </div>Technically the Realm is slated for release before DBs so we'd be looking at DBs about this time next year. I'm actually pretty curious about what's going to be in the Realm book, since it comes out so far in front of the DB book, it probably has a lot of stuff that's usable for Solars.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T22:07:42-08:00","id":758007,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't count on that. I think what's more likely is that they will write/are writing the Dragonblood and Realm books together, making sure everything fits, and that they have it all fresh in their minds. But, checking and re-checking and playtesting the DB charms will take much longer than revising the fluff, so the book will be out later.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T22:15:01-08:00","id":758019,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=757917#post757917\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Technically the Realm is slated for release before DBs so we'd be looking at DBs about this time next year.</div> </div> </div> </div>A year between major Exalt releases seems like it'd be really, really bad news for the line, particularly since they're pushing stuff like Exigents ahead of Lunars, Sidereals, Abyssals and Infernals. And that's after the 2+ year wait for the corebook, mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Have you ever read a Coik post before, man? lol<br /> -Holden<br /> <br />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/338-coik","name":"Coik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar338_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"611"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T22:22:38-08:00","id":758028,"title":"","content":"Isn't the plan Core -&gt; Dragons -&gt; Exigents -&gt; Abyssals -&gt; Sids -&gt; Lunars? Then Infernals and Alchemicals some time in the distant future, along with all the new non-Exigent splats?<br /> <br /> But yes, one major splat a year would mean 2020 before the 'basic' ones were covered.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T22:29:40-08:00","id":758033,"title":"","content":"For the record, the four &quot;classic&quot; Exalt books for 2nd Edition were released in less than two years of each other, with Graceful Wicked Masques, Infernals and Alchemicals being released in the next one and a half years. It might be slightly slower and longer for 3rd, but I doubt we'd get one book per year.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;From now on, instead of saying 'half-assed', I will use 'muled'. 'This is a muled job, Chris', I will say to my friend Chris. 'You need to do better, or your ass is grass. And not, like, metaphorical grass. There are weeds growing in there as we speak.'<br /> <br /> &quot;'The DEA is after you, man' I will tell him, in all seriousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8891-khantalas","name":"Khantalas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8891_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"899"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T22:58:32-08:00","id":758067,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Coik</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=758019#post758019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A year between major Exalt releases seems like it'd be really, really bad news for the line, particularly since they're pushing stuff like Exigents ahead of Lunars, Sidereals, Abyssals and Infernals. And that's after the 2+ year wait for the corebook, mind.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well think about it, the core hasn't dropped yet but it probably will in 1-2 months, then there's arms of the chosen, which is fairly crunch heavy, so that'll take a lot of dev resources, then the Realm, which needs slightly less dev resources but just as much editing and layout. Arms will be on the small side, maybe the Realm will be too but DBs is probably going to be pretty big. Much smaller than the core but still big. We just saw how long the process can take, I think layout technically started at the very begining of last spring? Then we've got things like Towers and Different Skies and all sorts of stuff, if we get 2 softcover suppliments for every splatbook that basically means they have six months to do a splat and 3 months for each softcover, start to finish.<br /> <br /> I don't think that sounds totally unreasonable. I understand there's obviously overlap, you don't totally finish one book and then start on another, but it does mean starting a new project every 3-6 months and keeping up with that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T03:39:17-08:00","id":758345,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=758067#post758067\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well think about it, the core hasn't dropped yet but it probably will in 1-2 months, then there's arms of the chosen, which is fairly crunch heavy, so that'll take a lot of dev resources, then the Realm, which needs slightly less dev resources but just as much editing and layout. Arms will be on the small side, maybe the Realm will be too but DBs is probably going to be pretty big. Much smaller than the core but still big. We just saw how long the process can take, I think layout technically started at the very begining of last spring? Then we've got things like Towers and Different Skies and all sorts of stuff, if we get 2 softcover suppliments for every splatbook that basically means they have six months to do a splat and 3 months for each softcover, start to finish.<br /> <br /> I don't think that sounds totally unreasonable. I understand there's obviously overlap, you don't totally finish one book and then start on another, but it does mean starting a new project every 3-6 months and keeping up with that.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think the point is whether or not it's reasonable in publishing/development terms, but rather in &quot;expecting to maintain interest in the line&quot; terms. If they publish Exalt-types one book a year, well, 3E is pretty much going to be forgotten in a year or two, because people just aren't interested in waiting that long. It would be better to ditch all the non-Exalt-type books if they're really causing the kind of delay you're suggesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8973-eurhetemec","name":"Eurhetemec","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T03:55:19-08:00","id":758382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=758028#post758028\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Isn't the plan Core -&gt; Dragons -&gt; Exigents -&gt; Abyssals -&gt; Sids -&gt; Lunars? Then Infernals and Alchemicals some time in the distant future, along with all the new non-Exigent splats?</div> </div> </div> </div>I've not seen anything from the Devs which says anything other than Core -&gt; Dragonblooded -&gt; Exigents then no comment.<br /> <br /> I'm expecting Lunars -&gt; Sids -&gt; Abyssals, as that more closely matches previous editions release schedules.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1181-molez","name":"Molez","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1181_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T04:29:29-08:00","id":758425,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Coik</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=758019#post758019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A year between major Exalt releases seems like it'd be really, really bad news for the line, particularly since they're pushing stuff like Exigents ahead of Lunars, Sidereals, Abyssals and Infernals. And that's after the 2+ year wait for the corebook, mind.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I hope it doesn't take that long, but I haven't seen anything across their lines that makes me think they can be speedy with the production of books. Paradox may be a good thing there, tighter deadlines perhaps and more cash if they want to kick start things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2325-builder","name":"Builder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T05:45:33-08:00","id":758466,"title":"","content":"I think I saw somewhere that they were aiming for 1 Fatsplat every 6 months, with one being an existing Exalt type, and the other being a new one (after the core drop). A schedule which may slip from time to time, but should be doable now presuming that the game, and the art direction for the game, has a fairly solid foundation for the later splats to build on.<br /> <br /> But don't ask me to say where, when, or if I'm not imagining it as a form of wishful thinking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a Woman, I'm a GM. <i>Of course</i> I'm Evil.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/424-dawaterrat","name":"DaWaterRat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T05:51:51-08:00","id":758472,"title":"","content":"It will be sometime in mid-sumer that our group will be able to get an Exalted game going. We have one player that is the perfect person to create an Exigent because they are never happy with standard classes. Thus I hope Q1 will be Exalted core and Arms of the Chosen, Q2 The Realm and Dragon Blooded, Q3 Exigent. That would work very well for our group and I give it a small chance. <br /> <br /> /crosses_fingers_and_toes hmmm I seem to do that a lot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>while (horse.state == dead)<br /> {<br /> beat();<br /> }","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/830-amdramnar","name":"Amdramnar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T07:57:17-08:00","id":758654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Coik</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=758019#post758019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A year between major Exalt releases seems like it'd be really, really bad news for the line, particularly since they're pushing stuff like Exigents ahead of Lunars, Sidereals, Abyssals and Infernals. And that's after the 2+ year wait for the corebook, mind.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't disagree with you, Coik; I've seen that sort of laggardly release absolutely murder interest in other gamelines. (I'm looking in your direction, One Ring!)<br /> <br /> But it's the sort of thing that may not be avoidable. OPP lacks the resources WW had behind it back in the day (no judgment, it just does; that doesn't speak badly of them in any way) and even if it didn't, there's some evidence that WW's release schedule back in the day was way, way, way to aggressive. Having to adhere to it meant that Lunars sort of got the shit kicked out of them not once but twice.<br /> <br /> People keep saying the release of the 3e core can't be taken as representative of anything, but the thing has been text-complete for nine or ten months now and they still haven't even finished getting all the art they need to get. That's... worrying.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;SEX NOVA is the kind of person who, after being chosen as the divine champion of the god of heroes, decided to call himself SEX NOVA.&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4742-murcushio","name":"Murcushio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4742_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1249"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T08:24:04-08:00","id":758681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murcushio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=758654#post758654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">People keep saying the release of the 3e core can't be taken as representative of anything, but the thing has been text-complete for nine or ten months now and they still haven't even finished getting all the art they need to get. That's... worrying.</div> </div> </div> </div>The book is unusually large, with a pretty high density of art, and hit some big delays that may have thrown off the timeline with artists. I agree with everything else you said, but I'm not going to form a judgment on art until we see one or two other books in the line.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"color:#696969\">When all the world was very young<br /> And mountain magic heavy hung<br /> The supermen would walk in file<br /> Guardians of a loveless isle</span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2010-root","name":"Root","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2010_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1014"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T08:31:12-08:00","id":758722,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murcushio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=758654#post758654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't disagree with you, Coik; I've seen that sort of laggardly release absolutely murder interest in other gamelines. (I'm looking in your direction, One Ring!)<br /> <br /> But it's the sort of thing that may not be avoidable. OPP lacks the resources WW had behind it back in the day (no judgment, it just does; that doesn't speak badly of them in any way) and even if it didn't, there's some evidence that WW's release schedule back in the day was way, way, way to aggressive. Having to adhere to it meant that Lunars sort of got the shit kicked out of them not once but twice.<br /> <br /> People keep saying the release of the 3e core can't be taken as representative of anything, but the thing has been text-complete for nine or ten months now and they still haven't even finished getting all the art they need to get. That's... worrying.</div> </div> </div> </div>On a positive note, this is something the Paradox deal could potentially help with, if they're interested in seeing Exalted 3E succeed. Money really can solve a lot of problem here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8973-eurhetemec","name":"Eurhetemec","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T08:35:01-08:00","id":758758,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Phaide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta#post756895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi. Just wondering when we might see the books that are now in second draft form become available as PDFs. Thanks.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The most accurate ETA is &quot;a few years late&quot;.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:9px\">Sorry if someone else already did that joke, too lazy to check the whole thread.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The fool can only learn from a sage, but only the sage can learn from a fool.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2172-jack-in-the-box","name":"Jack In The Box","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T08:35:58-08:00","id":758767,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murcushio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=758654#post758654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't disagree with you, Coik; I've seen that sort of laggardly release absolutely murder interest in other gamelines. (I'm looking in your direction, One Ring!)</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's kinda worse nowadays, honestly. People are used to getting things quickly. I can go to iTunes and have music downloaded in a minute. Anything I order from Amazon I can expect to be at my door in two days. I can go to DrivethroughRPG right now and have a dozen new RPGs sitting on my harddrive waiting to be read in about five minutes.<br /> <br /> Time Was Back in the Day (tm) the only options a lot of people had were whatever their FLGS (or NSFLGS, as the case may be) chose to carry; I've seen stores where D&amp;D was 90% of the stock, stores where you could only expect a handful of RPGs because the owner was huge into 40k, and the like. But people have options now and, in my experience, options breed impatience.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> But it's the sort of thing that may not be avoidable. OPP lacks the resources WW had behind it back in the day (no judgment, it just does; that doesn't speak badly of them in any way) and even if it didn't, there's some evidence that WW's release schedule back in the day was way, way, way to aggressive. Having to adhere to it meant that Lunars sort of got the shit kicked out of them not once but twice. </div> </div> </div>Yeah, don't get me wrong, I'm not necessarily saying they should be emulating White Wolf's old release schedule. Everything that I've heard is that it was an extraordinarily unhealthy way to run a business. On the other hand, as hippokrene points out, if I have to tell the Lunar fans of my aquintance that they need to wait until they're making optometrist jokes before the 3e Lunars book drops, it's going to be <i>extraordinarily</i> harder to convince them that they should give a single fuck about Exalted. &quot;Publish or perish&quot; may have originated in academia, but it's crossed over into other realms as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Have you ever read a Coik post before, man? lol<br /> -Holden<br /> <br />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/338-coik","name":"Coik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar338_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"611"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T08:52:07-08:00","id":758789,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Coik</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=758767#post758767\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, don't get me wrong, I'm not necessarily saying they should be emulating White Wolf's old release schedule. Everything that I've heard is that it was an extraordinarily unhealthy way to run a business. On the other hand, as hippokrene points out, if I have to tell the Lunar fans of my aquintance that they need to wait until they're making optometrist jokes before the 3e Lunars book drops, it's going to be <i>extraordinarily</i> harder to convince them that they should give a single fuck about Exalted. &quot;Publish or perish&quot; may have originated in academia, but it's crossed over into other realms as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's almost as if this is an extraordinarily complex business without a lot of easy answers or obvious solutions! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (I'm glad I don't have to call these shots. I've given Rich my share of loudmouthed guff, but whatever he's paying himself, it is not enough.)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;SEX NOVA is the kind of person who, after being chosen as the divine champion of the god of heroes, decided to call himself SEX NOVA.&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4742-murcushio","name":"Murcushio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4742_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1249"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T09:07:18-08:00","id":758844,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murcushio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=758789#post758789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's almost as if this is an extraordinarily complex business without a lot of easy answers or obvious solutions! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (I'm glad I don't have to call these shots. I've given Rich my share of loudmouthed guff, but whatever he's paying himself, it is not enough.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I sure enjoyed the 'pay the writers more' stretch goal. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T10:44:39-08:00","id":759026,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tikor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=758844#post758844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I sure enjoyed the 'pay the writers more' stretch goal.</div> </div> </div> </div>I hope the writers enjoy their 15% bonus when they finally get paid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T12:18:24-08:00","id":759131,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murcushio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=758654#post758654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">People keep saying the release of the 3e core can't be taken as representative of anything, but the thing has been text-complete for nine or ten months now and they still haven't even finished getting all the art they need to get. That's... worrying.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm giving them the benefit of the doubt because I remember when Exalted managed to release new books at a steady pace and because the thought of waiting 9-10 months (minimum!) for a new book annoys me.<br /> <br /> That is, I'll take the developers' and writers' word that the core is a vast anomaly until they give me reason to believe otherwise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T20:17:44-08:00","id":759666,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/756895-dragon-blood-eta?p=759131#post759131\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm giving them the benefit of the doubt because I remember when Exalted managed to release new books at a steady pace and because the thought of waiting 9-10 months (minimum!) for a new book annoys me.<br /> <br /> That is, I'll take the developers' and writers' word that the core is a vast anomaly until they give me reason to believe otherwise.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm going to agree with Hippo on this one. The Core is the one book that they have to get as close to perfect as possible. The core rules will affect every single splat and supplement they release. Every new rule will be based off the core's concepts and rules. If they have to errata a splat, well it's annoying but sometimes that's how it is. If/when they errata the Core, they have to look at every other product they've released and see how those new rules affect whats already in existence. That makes the Core far more unique then any other possible book. It is the anomaly they they're trying to &quot;get just right&quot;.<br /> <br /> I think the next year with: Arms of the Chosen, The Realm, Dragonbloods, etc. is what will really set the tone for releases. It sucks, but we're gonna have to wait and see how things progress.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2103-talosx","name":"TalosX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"588"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T20:27:10-08:00","id":759669,"title":"","content":"Also, the Core is just longer. And requires vastly more playtesting.<br /> <br /> Oh, and the lead developer got extremely sick, that probably slowed it down a lot, and it's unlikely that will happen again.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}